@model PEMS.Application.DTOs.FunctionalLocationImportBatchDto
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@using PEMS.Web.Resources
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> Localizer
@{
    string StatusBadge(string status) => status switch
    {
        "New" => "bg-success",
        "Existing" => "bg-secondary",
        "Conflict" => "bg-warning text-dark",
        "Invalid" => "bg-danger",
        _ => "bg-light text-dark"
    };
}

<div class="content-card mb-3">
    <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-md-3"><strong>@Localizer["File:"]</strong> @Model.FileName</div>
        <div class="col-md-2"><strong>Source Rows:</strong> @Model.SourceRowCount</div>
        <div class="col-md-2"><strong>Expanded:</strong> @Model.ExpandedLocationCount</div>
        <div class="col-md-2"><strong>New / Existing:</strong> @Model.NewCount / @Model.ExistingCount</div>
        <div class="col-md-1"><strong>Conflicts:</strong> @Model.ConflictCount</div>
        <div class="col-md-2"><strong>@Localizer["Status:"]</strong> <span class="badge @(Model.Status == "Committed" ? "bg-success" : "bg-secondary")">@Model.Status</span></div>
    </div>

    @if (Model.Status == "Staging")
    {
        <div class="pems-command-bar">
            <form asp-action="Commit" method="post">
                <input type="hidden" name="batchId" value="@Model.FunctionalLocationImportBatchId" />
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-pems-solid" onclick="return confirm('Commit the selected rows into the live Functional Locations register?')">
                    <i class="bi bi-check-circle"></i> Commit Selected Rows
                </button>
            </form>
            <form asp-action="Discard" method="post">
                <input type="hidden" name="batchId" value="@Model.FunctionalLocationImportBatchId" />
                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-outline-danger" onclick="return confirm('Discard this entire import batch?')">
                    <i class="bi bi-trash"></i> Discard Batch
                </button>
            </form>
        </div>
    }
</div>

<div class="content-card">
    <div class="table-responsive table-scroll-area" style="max-height:65vh; overflow-y:auto;">
        <table class="table table-enterprise">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>@Localizer["Include"]</th><th>@Localizer["Src Row"]</th><th>@Localizer["Code"]</th><th>@Localizer["Name"]</th><th>Parent / Area</th><th>@Localizer["Status"]</th><th>@Localizer["Action"]</th><th>@Localizer["Note"]</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                @foreach (var r in Model.Rows)
                {
                    <tr>
                        <td>
                            @if (Model.Status == "Staging")
                            {
                                <form asp-action="ToggleRow" method="post">
                                    <input type="hidden" name="rowId" value="@r.FunctionalLocationImportRowId" />
                                    <input type="hidden" name="batchId" value="@Model.FunctionalLocationImportBatchId" />
                                    <input type="hidden" name="include" value="@(!r.IncludeInCommit)" />
                                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm @(r.IncludeInCommit ? "btn-success" : "btn-outline-secondary")" style="width:36px;">
                                        <i class="bi @(r.IncludeInCommit ? "bi-check-lg" : "bi-x-lg")"></i>
                                    </button>
                                </form>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                @(r.IncludeInCommit ? "Yes" : "No")
                            }
                        </td>
                        <td>@r.SourceRowNumber</td>
                        <td><strong>@r.Code</strong>@if (r.Payload?.IsAreaParentRow == true) { <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border ms-1">Area parent</span> }</td>
                        <td class="small">@r.Name</td>
                        <td class="small">@(r.ParentAreaName ?? r.Name)</td>
                        <td><span class="badge @StatusBadge(r.Status)">@r.Status</span></td>
                        <td class="small">@r.Action</td>
                        <td class="small">
                            @if (r.ValidationMessage != null)
                            {
                                <span class="text-muted" style="white-space:normal;">@r.ValidationMessage</span>
                            }
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                }
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    @if (!Model.Rows.Any()) { <p class="text-muted text-center py-4">No Functional Location rows recognized in this file.</p> }
</div>
